# Trial by Water (outlands 133): the battlefield entered while accepted, then the quest set available by GM inside the
# arena: the win's 32001 (canSkipCS 1, battlefieldWin not set) is finished while available: Heir of the Great Water and
# the Whisper of Tides all the same (the finish reads no status; kept Lua quirk). Edal-Tahdal, available at fame level 1
# with the whisper: 113.
char zone=CloisterOfTides pos=557.5,35.1,563.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWater accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfWater
login
trigger WP_Entrance                       # accepted, the fork: 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
quest Outlands.TrialByWater available
kill LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-21               # won while available: 32001 (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # Heir of the Great Water, the Whisper of Tides
warp -13.0,1.1,-19.0 Norg
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # available, fame level 1, the whisper: 113
finish
